# shared/link — core<->head talk-wire codec (TASK 3, placeholder).

Locked link map (swapped 2026-09-28 — OLED SDA pullup on GPIO12 bricked
boot, see head/include/mcu/esp32cam_ov3660.h):
- 2-wire UART: CAM TX=GPIO12/RX=GPIO13 <-> S3 GPIO17/18 (UART1).
- S3-waits-for-AWAKE boot rule (extends to the pin level: S3 keeps TX
  tristated until the CAM is up — it must never drive GPIO12 during CAM
  reset), drop-stale-frames, `[HEAD]` log prefix.
- OLED on CAM SDA=GPIO14/SCL=GPIO15; GPIO2/4 reserved; star 5V power.

The real codec (framing, AWAKE handshake, stale-frame drop) lands in
task 3, shared by `core/` and `head/` from this directory.
Normative protocol source until then: `core/src/middleware/udp_codec.h`
(core<->app UDP contract — unrelated to this link).
